```
{ path, event: 'created'|'modified'|'deleted'|'moved'|'unknown', type: 'file'|'directory'|'symlink'|undefined, changes: {...} }
```

fsevents backend uses getInfo. Fallback uses fs.watch and guesses event/type.

Let me write fsevents-backend.js:
```js
